msgctxt "212"
msgid "Okay, what's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"So there's this girl who works at the burger joint. The\r\n"
"moment I saw her, it was love at first sight. I just don't\r\n"
"know the right way to tell her how I feel..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"I've never liked anyone like this before... And when I asked\r\n"
"my friends at school to help me, they just made fun of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"I made it to the front of the shop today, but I couldn't\r\n"
"get myself to actually go in. That's where I'm at..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "So, that's your problem? I don't know if I'll be much help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"What would you do if you were in my shoes!? Would you\r\n"
"just straight-up tell her how you feel, or..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Let's see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Just suck it up and talk to her. Man up and tell her\r\n"
"how you feel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "You're right, I should just man up! Okay, here I go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "(Heh. Go for it, kid.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Well, what'd she say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"The only thing I could say was my order. Now I've got an empty heart and a "
"full stomach..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "What happened? Someone else butt in on your confession?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"No, it was all me... I tried, but I couldn't get myself to\r\n"
"talk to her after all. What am I gonna do now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "You really do need help, huh? In that case, how about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Why not try writing her a letter? If you're having trouble\r\n"
"speaking the words, you could try handing them to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"That's a great idea! I already wrote her a love letter,\r\n"
"too! I have it on me, even. I'll go give it to her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "...Well, he certainly came prepared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Did you give it to her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "...No. I bought a burger instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "...What happened to the letter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"I couldn't find the courage to give it to her... I'm so\r\n"
"pathetic. What am I gonna do now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "This is worse than I thought. In that case, how about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"You should probably give up on her. If you can't even\r\n"
"manage asking her out, then you must not be that\r\n"
"into her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"But... I can't. I just can't give up like that. My\r\n"
"feelings for her are real!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"I'd rather risk everything and be humiliated than give\r\n"
"up on her now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"(Heh... Looks like he's finally found the courage. Let's see\r\n"
"where that takes him.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "How'd it go? Did you tell her what you wanted?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"Yes. She recommended the burger and fries combo, so that's what I got. It "
"was actually pretty good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"I meant if you asked her out or not. You said you were going to\r\n"
"risk it all. What happened to your courage?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"I couldn't risk anything but my appetite. Go on, laugh. I know you want to. "
"I'm as spineless as a slug..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"I won't laugh, but I'll agree with you on the spineless\r\n"
"part."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Invite her to see a movie with you. It's a tried and true\r\n"
"classic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"You're right! There's a romantic comedy out this week, too!\r\n"
"I'll go ask her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid ""
"(I've got the sinking feeling his invitation isn't\r\n"
"going to make it past his lips.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "How'd it go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"I got a shake with my burger combo... It was almost too\r\n"
"much food for me to eat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid ""
"How many burgers does that make now? More\r\n"
"importantly, did you ask her about that movie?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"Well, she was talking to one of the other workers about\r\n"
"how she hates going to movie theaters... It just wasn't the\r\n"
"right time to ask her to see a movie, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "You sure you're serious about this girl?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid ""
"How about you text her how you feel? I'm not a big fan of\r\n"
"doing stuff like that over text, but if you can't tell her\r\n"
"in person, that might be your best bet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "Oh, good idea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Wait..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "I don't have her number..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"That should've been your first reaction to that suggestion.\r\n"
"What else..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"Just walk up to her and ask her out. All you have to do is\r\n"
"tell her you're interested, and see where it goes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "What? But... but I can't do that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid ""
"Quit whining! Of course you can do it! Straighten out that\r\n"
"spine of yours, or I'll straighten it out for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Okay, okay! I'll give it all I've got! Here goes nothing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid "(If this doesn't work, he's sore out of luck.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "How'd it go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "The best I can manage right now is ordering burgers..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid ""
"I don't understand how you can even eat that much. Guess it's up to me to "
"do something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid ""
"I did it! She talked to me! She told me I must really\r\n"
"love hamburgers to be buying so many!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "Wait, what's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "It means she talked to me! She recognized me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid "But did you ask her out on a date?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1244"
msgid "Uh, well... No, she just talked to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid ""
"But she smiled and said, \"Wow, you must really love hamburgers\"! So I had "
"to order the most expensive combo to prove it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "What the hell are you doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid "You can have it if you want. I'm too full..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>King Smile Burger Set<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "I'm out of options... I have no idea what I should do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid ""
"You're an idiot, but now that we've taken things this far,\r\n"
"I can't abandon you here. I'll lend you a hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid ""
"All right. I'm gonna go into the shop and ask her out\r\n"
"for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid "Wait, what!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid ""
"Look, you're not getting anywhere with this. I'll talk\r\n"
"to her for you, just follow me in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid "Wait, but...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1388"
msgid "Just pipe down and follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid "Suck it up and talk to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1424"
msgid "Invite her to a movie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1436"
msgid "You could write her a letter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid "Send her a text message."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid "Just give up on her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1472"
msgid "Ask her out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1484"
msgid "I'll go tell her how you feel."
msgstr ""

